      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/sleetmute_alaska",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Russian explorers first reached the Sleetmute area in the early 1800s, bringing fur trade goods but no large‑scale settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
